OL,3,GNEWSAFive arrested on bus after
OL,4,Ateenager stabbed
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive people have been arrested after a
OL,7,Fteenage boy was stabbed in Birmingham
OL,8,Fon Tuesday.
OL,10,FWest Midlands Police said they were
OL,11,Fcalled to Yew Tree Lane, in Yardley, at
OL,12,Faround 14:10 GMT. They found a teenager
OL,13,Fwith serious injuries, who was taken to
OL,14,Fhospital.
OL,16,FThe force said it tracked a group of
OL,17,Fsuspects and arrested them from a bus
OL,18,Fnearby. They also recovered a knife
OL,19,Fwhich has been seized for examination.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
